# Generated native projects (Continuous Native Generation).
#
# `npx expo prebuild` writes these, and `expo/android/app/build` alone is ~1.5GB
# of Gradle output. Neither has ever been tracked; without these lines one
# `git add -A` tries to commit the lot. Nothing in them is unrecoverable -- the
# only keystore is the standard Expo debug key, which prebuild regenerates.
android/
ios/
